{"v":4,"catch":"來自GameJam的創意獨立遊戲。過去的你會變成一個幽靈，和當下的你一起解開謎題。","desc":"- 你將扮演一顆在 10 秒內爆炸的炸彈，設法在爆炸前到達目標門。\n- 每次爆炸後，炸彈會重生，開始新一輪遊戲，並生成一個代表你上次軌跡的「影子幽靈」。\n- 異想天開的謎題：這款遊戲透過 70 多個關卡中的各種以時間為核心的謎題來挑戰你的智力，包括磁鐵、激光，甚至可以停止計時器的物品。","publisher":"Happy Player","release":"2024-09-12","genres":["益智","策略","動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/77088a95f25408ec48ebe25c4b795d9d3799925e635b510740023814bd252746.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2ae3c6210a2802890d286ad8c8a9c4ed21e29a062b7ae434ff8b43c6416a9c55.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/09b8d73f3a7e929b6d7dbcbe3dea23f570266af73d00eed16f3b895ff92822e5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e7b99f3776206767cb84266ac2391657c6d23bf281b9206b7b4ec28336c50aef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6b0bf29f127bd02a2022d7c5d15d13dc9358af45d19e21e22ecac27c47525928.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/415a9d9a697086b2f14f2b16b14f12aeb3c2e27025cad9717785b4b35b5b2623.jpg"],"titleId":"01007df020716000","dlc":[]}